+
+No `PROFILE surfaces` registry is declared in `project.md`. Before a readiness claim beyond IMPL-GREEN, project-profile must establish the registry; missing, unreachable, or placeholder surfaces are findings. The future command is `bash .speck/scripts/profile-drift-check.sh --claim <state>` with coverage of every declared row.
+
